<title>LATVIA: Latvian Sept mo/mo inflation 0.7 pct, yr/yr 16.2.</title>
<headline>Latvian Sept mo/mo inflation 0.7 pct, yr/yr 16.2.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian inflation was at 0.7 percent on a monthly basis in September, compared with August's 0.5 percent deflation, and the year-on-year inflation in September was 16.2 percent, the statistics committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN CONSUMER PRICES   Sept '96   Aug '96   Sept '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change     +0.7	 -0.5	+1.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	 +16.2	+17.5     +23.7</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
